    "causal_summary": "Reorder auto-select provider cascade to Ollama → hf-local → OpenAI → Voyage (local-first). Change HF_LOCAL_MODEL fallback from BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 to nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5 so new users with sentence-transformers get the same embedder as Ollama users. Update test, INSTALL_GUIDE, opencode.json/mcp.json env notes, all related READMEs, doctor commands, and write ADR-014.",
